  "description": "A high-performance road bike at a price that's hard to beat. With a quality, lightweight aluminium frame, carbon fibre fork and durable groupset from Shimano, this is a machine that'll let you attack the open road without assaulting your wallet.\n\nLet the road open up in front of you. The SCULTURA RIM 100 takes everything we know about creating lightweight aluminium frame design and combines it with our unparalleled road racing heritage to deliver a high-value, high-performance road bike. With Shimano's durable and swift shifting CUES 2x9-speed drivetrain and our specially selected finishing kit, this is a bike that will give miles of service and pleasure, wherever it may take you.\n\nThe SCULTURA range has always stood for lightweight, road racing performance with a heritage that can be matched by few, but our SCULTURA RIM bikes offer the benefit of our years of road bike knowledge at a price point that's available to everyone. At MERIDA, we know how to create quality, long-lasting aluminium frames, so it's fitting we choose this material for our SCULTURA road bikes that give top flight performance at an accessible price, sitting alongside our top-end carbon offerings. With geometry that's precise enough for seasoned riders yet welcoming to new recruits to the fast-paced world of drop bar bikes, these are machines that let the road open up in front of you.",
